; Phantom-lot rejection negative fixture (#237).
;
; Beancount's STRICT booking method rejects a reducing posting whose
; lot key references a per-unit cost that was never augmented in the
; account. Two real lots exist (1500 USD and 1600 USD); the third
; transaction sells "a 1700 USD lot" that was never bought. bean-check
; raises a `ReductionError("No position matches ...")` and doppio's
; Beancount frontend (defaulting to LotValidationMode::Strict) raises
; ElaborationError::PhantomLotReduction.

2024-01-01 open Assets:Coins
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash USD
2024-01-01 open Income:Trading USD

2024-01-15 * "Buy"
  Assets:Coins   10 GOLD {1500.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash   -15000.00 USD

2024-02-15 * "Buy more"
  Assets:Coins   10 GOLD {1600.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash   -16000.00 USD

2024-03-15 * "Sell, claiming a $1700 lot we never bought"
  Assets:Coins  -10 GOLD {1700.00 USD, 2024-01-15} @ 1750.00 USD
  Assets:Cash   17500.00 USD
  Income:Trading
